WEBVTT

00:13:25.622 --> 00:13:30.022
And businesses are increasingly adopting
family-friendly policies,

00:13:30.046 --> 00:13:32.153
not just because
it's the right thing to do,

00:13:32.177 --> 00:13:34.082
but because it's good for their workers.

00:13:34.106 --> 00:13:35.604
It's good for their business.

00:13:36.555 --> 00:13:38.254
Number two:

00:13:38.278 --> 00:13:41.741
We have to remember,
in the words of Fannie Lou Hamer,

00:13:41.765 --> 00:13:45.285
that "nobody's free
'til everybody's free."

00:13:45.665 --> 00:13:47.288
So as I mentioned earlier,

00:13:47.312 --> 00:13:50.818
women of color in this country
didn't even get the right to vote

00:13:50.842 --> 00:13:53.765
until much further along
than the rest of us.

00:13:54.257 --> 00:13:57.212
But since they did,
they are the most reliable voters,

00:13:57.236 --> 00:14:00.158
and women of color are the most
reliable voters for candidates